@startuml
title VPC-D02 VendorSystem / AdapterMapping / Connector Instance Model
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Site Group\nlookup/payment scope" as SG
component "ExitPass Site\nreporting + vendor + POS boundary" as Site
component "AdapterMapping\nSite to vendor object" as Mapping
component "VendorSystem\nconfigured Vendor PMS/HCP instance" as VS
component "Adapter codebase\nreusable vendor implementation" as Codebase
component "Connector instance\ndeployed runtime for VendorSystem" as CI
component "Vendor object reference\nvendorSystemId + vendorObjectType + vendorObjectRef" as VObj
component "Site POS Server\nfiscal authority for resolved Site" as POS

SG --> Site : may resolve to one or more Sites
Site --> Mapping : mapped for vendor integration
Mapping --> VS : uses configured vendor system
Mapping --> VObj : stores vendor-side object reference
CI --> VS : configured for
CI --> Codebase : runs
CI --> VObj : interacts with vendor object
Site --> POS : resolved Site determines fiscal routing

note right of VObj
HCP ParkingLotIndexCode is vendor-side identity only.
It maps through AdapterMapping and is not ExitPass site_id.
end note
@enduml
